          "convergenceTargetId": "1773649590528",
          "id": "1773324296229",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1773324296232_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a UI generator agent. Create a single editable recordWidget form to collect requested quote changes.\n\nInput:\n- Action context IDs: ID = {{$context.$nodes.GET_THE_ACTION_DETAILS.$output.result.id}}, TID = {{$context.$nodes.GET_THE_ACTION_DETAILS.$output.result.tid}}\n\nForm requirements:\n1) Form metadata\n- Use recordWidget\n- Properties must include ONLY: id, readOnly, fields (no other top-level properties in the recordWidget payload)\n- description: \"Requests submitted here are reviewed by our virtual sales representative for automatic handling. If further assistance is needed, they are forwarded to a sales representative for follow-up.\"\n- id: \"requestQuoteChanges~~<ID>~~<TID>\" where:\n  - <ID> is {{$context.$nodes.GET_THE_ACTION_DETAILS.$output.result.id}}\n  - <TID> is {{$context.$nodes.GET_THE_ACTION_DETAILS.$output.result.tid}}\n- readOnly: false\n\n2) Fields (single column, stacked vertically)\n- Field A (Changes Required)\n  - id: \"requestPrompt~~<ID>~~<TID>\"\n  - description: \"Requests submitted here are reviewed by our virtual sales representative for automatic handling. If further assistance is needed, they are forwarded to a sales representative for follow-up.\"\n  - type: \"textarea\"\n  - label: \"Changes Required *\"\n  - value: \"\" (an empty string)\n\n3) Strict constraints\n- Use the ids exactly as written, including the double tildes (~~); do not change case, punctuation, or separators.\n- Do not add any extra keys to the recordWidget properties beyond id, readOnly, fields.\n- Do not add extra field keys like placeholder, help, required, options, etc.\n- Do not emit JSON or any wrapper markup in this response unless required by your renderer. The platform will handle wrapping/formatting.\n- The textarea field’s value must be an empty string (\"\").\n\n4) Widget/layout guidance (non-binding if your renderer lacks layout controls)\n- Widget title: \"Request Changes\"\n- Widget description: \"Requests submitted here are reviewed by our virtual sales representative for automatic handling. If further assistance is needed, they are forwarded to a sales representative for follow-up.\"\n- Place this form in a standard, single-column layout.\n\n5) User-facing message (must be shown outside the form; do not include inside the recordWidget properties)\n- Display this exact message prominently near the form:\n  \"Requests submitted here are reviewed by our virtual sales representative for automatic handling. If further assistance is needed, they are forwarded to a sales representative for follow-up.\""
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "errorNodeId": "1768190969668",
            "name": "Transform Transaction Lines",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const quoteObject = $context.$nodes.GET_CHILD_LINES.$output;\nconst parentDocNumber = $context.$nodes.GET_THE_ACTION_DETAILS.$output.result.context.documentNumber;\n\nconst splitCPQResponse = (apiResponse, parentDocNumber) => {\n  const documents = apiResponse?.documents ?? {};\n\n  // Remove \"links\" recursively\n  const stripLinksDeep = (value) =>\n    Array.isArray(value)\n      ? value.map(stripLinksDeep)\n      : value && typeof value === \"object\"\n      ? Object.fromEntries(\n          Object.entries(value)\n            .filter(([key]) => key !== \"links\")\n            .map(([key, val]) => [key, stripLinksDeep(val)])\n        )\n      : value;\n\n  const items = documents?.transactionLine?.items ?? [];\n  const parentKey = String(parentDocNumber);\n\n  const parentTransactionLine =\n    items.find((line) => String(line?._document_number) === parentKey) || null;\n\n  const ChildTransactionLines = items.filter(\n    (line) => String(line?._parent_doc_number) === parentKey\n  );\n\n  const transaction = stripLinksDeep(\n    Object.fromEntries(\n      Object.entries(documents).filter(\n        ([key]) => key !== \"transactionLine\" && key !== \"links\"\n      )\n    )\n  );\n\n  return {\n    transaction,\n    parentTransactionLine: parentTransactionLine\n      ? stripLinksDeep(parentTransactionLine)\n      : null,\n    ChildTransactionLines: stripLinksDeep(ChildTransactionLines),\n  };\n};\n\nreturn splitCPQResponse(quoteObject, parentDocNumber);"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1776773077212"
          },
          "code": "TRANSFORM_TRANSACTION_LINES",
          "id": "1776773024933",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
